  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ut43Lym.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MarsThePlanet&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/laser-bridges-doors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/776337?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flaser-bridges-and-doors\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/laser-bridges-and-doors?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5NxocZK.gif\" alt=\"\"> <br>這個模組加入了外觀充滿未來感的雷射橋樑、門和柵欄，當雷射源方塊被紅石訊號啟動時，就會形成這些結構。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C17yBiD.gif\" alt=\"\"> <br>它們的長度取決於紅石訊號強度，並且會動態更新。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VsMln86.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uFErCaY.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <br>你可以手持染料對著雷射源方塊點擊來為它上色，或者使用發射器來施加染料。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VX4VIHg.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9qpoRLo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZ8J54O.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"> <br>要合成雷射源方塊，請在合成格中將一個玻璃方塊和七個鐵錠圍繞一個終界水晶擺放。你可以將雷射源方塊放入合成格來合成雷射柵欄源方塊，這種轉換是雙向的。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>設定：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>你可以在遊戲內直接設定此模組，或編輯設定檔資料夾中的 JSON 檔案 <code>config/laserbridges.json</code>。如果你使用 Fabric 並想在遊戲內調整設定值，你需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>show_next_level</strong> - 完全充能的雷射源方塊所產生的雷射最大長度。所有其他長度均以此值為基準計算，預設值為 15。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>blocks_cut_through_by_lasers</strong> - 可以被雷射穿過的方塊列表。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VMhMBQw.png\" height=\"400\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\"></a></p>",
